# Tailwind v4

CSS-first. Tokens live in `src/app/globals.css` via `@theme inline`. No `tailwind.config.js`. No `@tailwind base/components/utilities`.

```css
@import "tailwindcss";

@theme inline {
  --color-ink: var(--ink);
  --font-sans: var(--font-geist);
}
```

- Custom utilities: `@utility`. Custom variants: `@custom-variant`.
- Container queries are built-in: `@container`, `@sm:`, `@md:`, `@max-md:`.
- CSS variables in classes: `bg-(--ink)` not `bg-[--ink]`. Opacity: `bg-ink/80` not `bg-opacity-*`.
- Brand color is the custom `ink` / `paper` / `mute` / `rule` set — not unthemed zinc/slate.
- `site-shell` and `site-grid` already exist. Reuse them before inventing a new container.

```tsx
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-8 lg:grid-cols-12">
  <article className="@container min-w-0 md:col-span-6">
    <div className="flex flex-col @md:flex-row" />
  </article>
</div>
```
